## Dense sub-tables

* `0x2A808`–`0x2F7D8` : mixed, ~4 B .. 24 B steps (short strings).
* `0x2F7D8`–`0x3FC10` : **fixed 0x730 (1,840 B) stride** — large blobs (≥ 10 entries fully padded).
* `0x2E400`–`0x2E800` sample (ciphertext kept as ASCII placeholders):
  `Supjjb=Kbh|j#aoaw>]q~puc#Upzj|1sAOE` / `Ochfgq=Kbh|j#aoaw>]q~puc#Upzj|1sAOE` / `ld9*Hogqi&cd#Kgcu*`
  repeated prefixes across entries ⇒ the transform is position-dependent (stream/stateful),
  so a plain per-entry key is not enough to recover the text.
